msgstr "配置 AP 自身的 IP 地址"

msgid "Configure AP its own Port"
msgstr "配置 AP 自身的端口"

msgid "own_ip_addr is global setting ,in this point, let all mbss set the same ip addr for safe."
msgstr "own_ip_addr 是全局设置，基于这一点，为了安全起见，所有 MBSS 都应设置为相同的 IP 地址。"

msgid "own_radius_port is also global setting , let all mbss set the same port."
msgstr "own_radius_port 同是全局设置，所有 MBSS 也应设置为相同的端口。"

