msgid "Multi-Link Operation (MLO), enables simultaneous use of multiple radio links for improved performance and reliability."
msgstr "多链路操作（MLO）使得可以同时使用多个无线链路，从而提高性能和可靠性。"

msgid "MediaTek Mixed WDS: process 4-address frames of associated APClient/STA. Only interoperates with other MediaTek devices, for standard (mac80211-compatible) WDS use the WDS modes above instead."
msgstr "联发科混合 WDS：处理关联 AP 客户端/ STA 的4地址帧。仅与其他联发科设备互操作，对于标准（兼容 mac80211）WDS，请使用上述 WDS 模式。"

msgid "802.11r Reliability"
msgstr "802.11r 可靠性"

msgid "Enabling MTK reliability 802.11r may improve the roaming stability of legacy or IoT clients at the cost of switching speed."
msgstr "启用 MTK 可靠性 802.11r，可能以切换速度为代价，提升老旧或 IoT 客户端的漫游稳定性。"
